# Composed documents, written by the isms pre-render hook. Root-anchored: the baseline
# sources in _extensions/isms/docs/ are tracked.
/docs/
# The deviations register, written by the same hook. At the root rather than in docs/
# because it is a report about the controlled documents, not one of them.
/deviations.qmd

# Rendered output and Quarto's caches.
_site/
site_libs/
.quarto/
_freeze/
**/*.quarto_ipynb


/.quarto/

/.pi/

# Raw source policy dropped in for ingestion. Kept out of version control so unreviewed
# source material never lands in the repo; the tracked .gitkeep preserves the directory.
/_ingest/input/*
!/_ingest/input/.gitkeep
